{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41588","headline":"赠王定保 · 沈彬","name":"赠王定保","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙桂曾攀第一枝，薄游湘水阻佳期。\n皋桥已失齐眉愿，萧寺行逢落发师。\n废苑露寒兰寂寞，丹山云断凤参差。\n闻公已有平生约，谢绝女萝依兔丝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈彬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41588.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41588","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}